# Only needed to install a development build on a physical iPhone.
# Copy to .env.local, which Git ignores. Expo Go and simulators need neither.

# Any identifier not already registered to another Apple team.
# PHOENIX_IOS_BUNDLE_ID=dev.yourname.phoenix-mobile

# Optional: your Apple team, from Xcode > Settings > Apple Accounts. A free Personal Team works.
# Without it, Xcode's signing setup picks or asks for a team.
# PHOENIX_APPLE_TEAM_ID=ABCDE12345
